# Defaults for `make stack-up STACK=cloud`. Shell variables and the root .env override them.
#
# OpenAI's current speech-to-text model and its cost-sensitive GPT-6 model.
# gpt-4o-transcribe and gpt-4o-mini-transcribe also work. For another
# OpenAI-compatible provider, change all three values.
GATEWAY_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
TRANSCRIPTION_MODEL=gpt-transcribe
POLISH_MODEL=gpt-6-luna
